# Project: Natural Language to Transaction Parser
Last Updated: 2024-12-30T17:00:00Z
Current Role: Executor

## Background and Motivation
The user needs a minimal prototype that demonstrates drift analysis in natural language to blockchain transaction conversion. The system will:
- Accept multiple natural language prompt variants describing the same transaction
- Convert each prompt to a JSON transaction payload using GPT
- Send MetaMask signing requests for each payload
- Display results showing how different phrasings produce identical (or different) transaction data

This prototype will help analyze how consistent GPT is at parsing semantically equivalent prompts into identical blockchain transactions.

**UPDATE**: User wants MAXIMUM SIMPLICITY - just needs simple blockchain proof of successful on-chain interaction.

**UPDATE 2**: Phase 1 complete! Now integrating with sophisticated video-demo.html to show real-time semantic drift testing.

